  "title": "Latvian Cottage Cheese Pancakes (Biezpiena Placenisi)",
  "description": "These Latvian-inspired cottage cheese pancakes with raisins are nice for breakfast, lunch, or a snack--try topping them with butter and honey or a touch of maple syrup.",
